OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross the West Midlands
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile the headlines are often filled
OL,7,Fwith more serious stories, there are
OL,8,Fstill plenty of positive and happier
OL,9,Fmoments happening across the West
OL,10,FMidlands - and we want to celebrate and
OL,11,Fshare them.
OL,13,FThis week, we have heard from a
OL,14,F91-year-old about how much he enjoys
OL,15,Fhis job at McDonald's and how a couple
OL,16,Fhave attracted millions of views on
OL,17,Fsocial media with videos built around a
OL,18,Fsimple daily question: "What's for
OL,19,Fdinner?"
